s:7px;background:#faeeda;color:#633806;">Child (12+)</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:#9a9aaa;">Likert 0–3</span></div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#1a1a2e;line-height:1.5;font-style:italic;">"Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you felt bad about yourself — or that you have let yourself or your family down?"</div></div><div style="background:#f8f7ff;border:1px solid #e8e7f5;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 13px;margin-bottom:7px;"><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:#9a9aaa;margin-bottom:6px;">PHQ-9A — Item 7</div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:6px;"><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:7px;background:#faeeda;color:#633806;">Child (12+)</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:#9a9aaa;">Likert 0–3</span></div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#1a1a2e;line-height:1.5;font-style:italic;">"Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you had trouble concentrating on things?"</div></div><div style="background:#f8f7ff;border:1px solid #e8e7f5;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 13px;margin-bottom:7px;"><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:#9a9aaa;margin-bottom:6px;">PHQ-9A — Item 8</div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-bottom:6px;"><span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:7px;background:#faeeda;color:#633806;">Child (12+)</span><span style="font-size:11px;color:#9a9aaa;">Likert 0–3</span></div><div style="font-size:13px;color:#1a1a2e;line-height:1.5;font-style:italic;">"Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you moved or spoken so slowly, or been so fidgety or restless that others noticed?"</div></div><div style="background:#f8f7ff;border:1px solid #e8e7f5;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 13px;margin-bottom:7px;"><div style="font-size:10px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:#9a9aaa;margin-bottom:6px;